<title>USA: 3-D Geophysical Inc names new CFO.</title>
<headline>3-D Geophysical Inc names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>3-D Geophysical Inc said Wednesday it has appointed Ronald Koons chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Koons succeeds John White, a founder of the company.</p>
<p>White will remain as a director and a member of the board executive committee. He also will serve as a consultant to the company and plans to form a private equity fund.</p>
<p>Most recently, Koons was executive vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer of Tuboscope Vetco International Corp.</p>
